{"title":"🎃 Free Movie Night: [REC] @ Innis Town Hall. With dinner","startsAt":"2026-10-02T18:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🎃 Free Movie Night: [REC] — Just in Time for Halloween!\n\nGet ready to kick off the Halloween season with one of the most intense horror movies of the 2000s! 👻\n\nJoin us Friday, October 2 at Innis Town Hall for a FREE screening of the 2007 Spanish horror classic [REC].\n\n📍 Innis Town Hall\n2 Sussex Avenue, Toronto\n🎬 Movie starts: 7:10 PM\n⏱️ Runtime: 78 minutes\n🇪🇸 Spanish with English subtitles\n\n🧟 About the Movie\n\nA television reporter and her cameraman follow a group of firefighters into an apartment building after receiving an emergency call. What starts as a routine assignment quickly turns into a terrifying nightmare when the building is sealed off—and something inside begins attacking the residents.\n\nIf you like found-footage horror, zombies, claustrophobic thrillers and movies that make you yell at the screen, this one is for you!\n\n🎥 Watch the trailer on YouTube:\n\n[https://youtu.be/oPvHTzqY2fM?si=aE6QjKvJ2Hlye0b8](https://youtu.be/oPvHTzqY2fM?si=aE6QjKvJ2Hlye0b8)\n\n👋 Meet Nick\n\nMeet Nick in the lobby before the movie.\nI'll have a Meetup sign so you can easily find me.\n\n💰 FREE EVENT!\n\nThere are NO charges or fees for this Meetup.\n\nPlease respect your RSVP—if you RSVP, please make every effort to attend.\n\nNot sure about your schedule yet? That's okay! You can simply just show up if you're unsure whether you'll be able to make it. No pressure to RSVP.\n\nCome out, meet some fellow movie fans, and get your Halloween season started with 78 minutes of pure terror! 🎃👻📽️[REC] is 78 minutes long according to IMDb and Rotten Tomatoes. Innis Town Hall is at 2 Sussex Avenue and is used for free film screenings.\n\nFor anyone who wants to keep the evening going, we'll walk about 10 minutes over to the Duke of York for food, drinks, and conversation. There we'll meet up with Mathew and the ghost walk attendees.","venue":{"name":"Innis Town Hall","address":"2 Sussex Ave, Toronto, ON M5S 1J5, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.665573,"lng":-79.39958,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/3/0/9/highres_536334025.jpeg"}